on" data-action="count-summary-close">×</button></div><div id="v20CountSummaryBody"></div><div class="v20-summary-actions"><button type="button" class="workflow-cancel" data-action="count-summary-close">INDIETRO</button><button type="button" class="success" data-action="count-apply">APPLICA RETTIFICHE</button></div>`;document.body.appendChild(d);return d};
ui.finalizeCount=function(){if(!this.countDraft)throw new Error('Nessun conteggio in corso.');const pending=this.countDraft.rows.filter(r=>!r.confirmed).length+(this.countDraft.extras||[]).filter(r=>!r.confirmed).length;if(pending)throw new Error(`Restano ${pending} articoli da confermare.`);const diffs=this.countDifferences(),unchanged=this.countDraft.rows.filter(r=>Number(r.counted)===Number(r.source.quantity)).length,positive=diffs.reduce((n,r)=>n+Math.max(0,r.delta),0),negative=diffs.reduce((n,r)=>n+Math.min(0,r.delta),0),net=positive+negative;this.countDraft.pendingSummary={unchanged,differences:diffs.length,positive,negative,net,diffs};this.persistCountDraft();const dialog=this.ensureCountSummaryDialog(),body=document.getElementById('v20CountSummaryBody');body.innerHTML=`<div class="v20-summary-session"><span>SESSIONE</span><b>${esc(this.countDraft.id)}</b></div><div class="v20-summary-grid"><div><b>${unchanged}</b><span>Senza differenze</span></div><div><b>${diffs.length}</b><span>Con differenze</span></div><div><b>+${positive}</b><span>Pezzi in più</span></div><div><b>${negative}</b><span>Pezzi in meno</span></div></div><div class="info-box"><b>Saldo netto: ${net>0?'+':''}${net} pezzi</b><br>Il MAGAZZINO non viene modificato finché non confermi “APPLICA RETTIFICHE”.</div>${diffs.length?`<div class="v20-summary-list">${diffs.map(r=>`<div class="v20-summary-row"><span><b>${esc(r.article)}${r.size?` · ${esc(r.size)}`:''}</b><small>${r.before} → ${r.after} · Fila/Scaffale ${esc(r.location||'—')} · Bancale ${esc(r.pallet||'—')}</small></span><strong class="${r.delta<0?'negative':'positive'}">${r.delta>0?'+':''}${r.delta}</strong></div>`).join('')}</div>`:'<div class="info-box">Nessuna differenza: il magazzino resterà invariato.</div>'}`;dialog.showModal()};
ui.countApplying=false;
ui.applyCount=async function(el){if(this.countApplying)return;if(!this.countDraft?.pendingSummary)throw new Error('Riepilogo conteggio non disponibile.');const d=this.countDraft,s=d.pendingSummary;this.countApplying=true;const btn=el||document.querySelector('[data-action="count-apply"]'),old=btn?.textContent;if(btn){btn.disabled=true;btn.textContent='APPLICAZIONE…'}try{for(const r of s.diffs)this.domain.rectifications.setQuantity({currentKey:r.key,article:r.article,size:r.size,state:r.state,location:r.location,pallet:r.pallet,counted:r.after,note:`Conteggio assistito · ${d.id}`,reason:'CONTEGGIO FISICO',method:'ASSISTED_COUNT',sessionId:d.id});this.domain.audit.record('COUNT_SESSION_COMPLETED','COUNT_SESSION',d.id,null,{location:d.location,pallet:d.pallet,startedAt:d.startedAt,completedAt:nowIso(),summary:{unchanged:s.unchanged,differences:s.differences,positive:s.positive,negative:s.negative,net:s.net}});this.countDraft=null;this.store.db.settings.countDraft=null;this.store.save('count:completed');document.getElementById('v20CountSummary')?.close();this.toast(`Conteggio ${d.id} concluso.`);this.router.go('stock')}finally{this.countApplying=false;if(btn?.isConnected){btn.disabled=false;btn.textContent=old||'APPLICA RETTIFICHE'}}};

/* =========================================================
   4) Event routing / input wrappers — solo azioni V20
   ========================================================= */
const oldAction=ui.action.bind(ui);ui.action=function(action,el){if(action==='rect-filter-toggle')return this.toggleRectFilters();if(action==='rect-step-minus')return this.rectStep(-1);if(action==='rect-step-plus')return this.rectStep(1);if(action==='rectify-save')return this.saveRectify(el);if(action==='count-finalize')return this.finalizeCount();if(action==='count-summary-close'){document.getElementById('v20CountSummary')?.close();return}if(action==='count-apply')return this.applyCount(el);return oldAction(action,el)};
const oldInput=ui.input.bind(ui);ui.input=function(el){if(el.id==='